                <mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf" value="1 · arm the stop&#xa;give the run&#39;s token to the base, so a later sleep THROWS" vertex="1">
